#: templates/admin/import-plausible.php:91
msgid ""
"Brings across daily pageviews and visitors, your pages, referrers, "
"countries, device types, and goals and custom events from a Plausible "
"export. Outbound link clicks, file downloads and form submissions become the"
" same events Vireo Analytics records itself, and 404 events are listed under"
